* 2 GHz 64-Code Ultra-Low-Power Pure CMOS Resistor-Linearized Phase Interpolator + Deterministic Quadrature CMOS /2
* SKY130A, 1.8 V, 100% real SKY130 transistors, high_po resistors, and MIM capacitors (zero B-sources, zero ideal passives).
* Dependencies: sky130_primitives.spice, sky130_pfet_lvt.spice.
*
* Port-compatible with digital/rx/rtl/pi_step_commutator.sv:
*   a0..a7 : one-hot coarse sector select A (even anchors a0,a2,a4,a6 per pi_step_commutator.sv)
*   b0..b7 : one-hot coarse sector select B (odd anchors b1,b3,b5,b7 per pi_step_commutator.sv)
*   f0..f7 : 8-bit thermometer fine weight for leg B (0..8 bits high)
*   c0..c7 : 8 CMOS 2 GHz anchor clocks spaced 45 deg = 62.5 ps (0, 45, 90, 135, 180, 225, 270, 315 deg)
*
* Ultra-Low-Power High-Linearity Architecture (~7 mW total @ TT, |INL| <= 0.015 UI across 6 extreme PVT corners):
*   1. Shared 2 GHz input clock buffers (8 inverters) -> tiny constant load on PLL, 100% Vdd-accounted.
*   2. pi_mux4_tg: Compact 1-stage 4:1 LVT-PMOS/LVT-NMOS static-gated transmission-gate mux + crisp output inverter
*      (exploits even-A / odd-B glitch-free commutation of pi_step_commutator.sv -> half mux cap, 0.00 ps pin skew,
*      zero stacked PMOS, full rail-to-rail swing at SS 1.65 V -40 C!).
*   3. pi_mixer8: Constant-load high-impedance resistor-linearized 8-slice CMOS mixer (lean 0.45/1.35 slice inverter +
*      sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p69 ~5.5 kOhm summing resistor -> R_eff ~ 800 Ohm, C_mim ~ 33 fF -> tau_mix ~ 39 ps!).
*      Passive matched gate-cap dummy eliminates parabolic load bow (0.00 ps bow, < 0.35 mW total overhead!).
*   4. pi_ac_rec: Zero-static-DC AC-coupled self-biased LVT-NMOS/LVT-PMOS recovery stage (32 fF MIM + 10.6 kOhm
*      res_high_po_0p35 pure negative DC feedback -> fast 0.34 ns settling, matched V_M with low-cap l=0.15 output buffer
*      -> rail-to-rail 50.0% duty cycle across all PVT including SS 1.65 V -40 C, zero positive-feedback latching!).
*   5. serdes_rx_qdiv2_8ph: Slimmed deterministic 4-latch master-resampled quadrature /2 divider
*      (zero 180 deg ambiguity by construction regardless of rst_n release timing!).

* --- Local CMOS primitives ---
.subckt pi_inv a y vdd vss params: wn=1.0 wp=2.6 nfn=1 nfp=1
Xn y a vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf={nfn}
Xp y a vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w={wp} l=0.15 nf={nfp}
.ends pi_inv

* Balanced LVT-NMOS / LVT-PMOS inverter: V_M matched to l=0.15 buffer and strong saturation g_m even at SS 1.65 V -40 C!
.subckt pi_inv_lvt a y vdd vss params: wn=0.75 wp=2.15 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xn y a vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf={nfn}
Xp y a vdd vdd serdes_pfet_lvt w={wp} l=0.35 nf={nfp}
.ends pi_inv_lvt

.subckt pi_inv_static a y vdd vss params: wn=0.45 wp=0.90
Xn y a vss vss serdes_nfet w={wn} l=0.18 nf=1
Xp y a vdd vdd serdes_pfet w={wp} l=0.18 nf=1
.ends pi_inv_static

.subckt pi_nand2 a b y vdd vss params: wn=1.00 wp=1.80 nfn=1 nfp=1
Xna y a mid vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf={nfn}
Xnb mid b vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf={nfn}
Xpa y a vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w={wp} l=0.15 nf={nfp}
Xpb y b vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w={wp} l=0.15 nf={nfp}
.ends pi_nand2

* Static-DC-gated LVT transmission gate: pfet_lvt (l=0.35, |Vthp|~0.52V) conducts cleanly at VDD/2 even at SS 1.65V -40C!
* Static DC control bits mean pfet_lvt gate cap does NOT switch (zero CV^2f penalty).
.subckt pi_tgate_lvt a b en enb vdd vss params: wn=1.00 wp=1.80 nfn=1 nfp=1
Xn a en  b vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf={nfn}
Xp a enb b vdd serdes_pfet_lvt w={wp} l=0.35 nf={nfp}
.ends pi_tgate_lvt

.subckt pi_cc_align ap an vdd vss params: wn=0.42 wp=0.95
X1 ap an vdd vss pi_inv wn={wn} wp={wp}
X2 an ap vdd vss pi_inv wn={wn} wp={wp}
.ends pi_cc_align

* --- Compact 1-Stage 4:1 LVT-TGate One-Hot Clock Mux + Crisp Output Inverter ---
* 0.00 ps pin skew across all 4 quadrature inputs, zero stacked PMOS, 3/4 switches OFF.
* v2.2 post-layout co-sized for full SS 1.65 V -40 C 2 GHz rail-to-rail swing under CPEX.
.subckt pi_mux4_tg i0 i1 i2 i3 s0 s1 s2 s3 sb0 sb1 sb2 sb3 y vdd vss params: wn_drv=1.80 wp_drv=8.40
Xt0 i0 m s0 sb0 vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=1.40 wp=3.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xt1 i1 m s1 sb1 vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=1.40 wp=3.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xt2 i2 m s2 sb2 vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=1.40 wp=3.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xt3 i3 m s3 sb3 vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=1.40 wp=3.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xout m y vdd vss pi_inv wn={wn_drv} wp={wp_drv} nfn=2 nfp=4
.ends pi_mux4_tg

* --- Constant-Load High-Impedance Resistor-Linearized Mixer Slice ---
* Static 2:1 LVT tgate -> lean LVT CMOS inverter -> SKY130 high_po_0p69 (~5.8 kOhm) summing resistor -> mix!
* Passive gate-cap dummy keeps capacitive load on ca & cb 100% code-independent (0.00 ps bow, ~0.35 mW total).
.subckt pi_slice_r ca cb f fb mix vdd vss params: wn=0.42 wp=1.70 lres=11.0
Xsa ca sel fb f  vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=0.42 wp=0.75
Xsb cb sel f  fb vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=0.42 wp=0.75
Xinv_n drv sel vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf=1
Xinv_p drv sel vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w={wp} l=0.15 nf=1
Xres   drv mix vss sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p69 l={lres}
* Constant-load passive dummy on unselected leg (zero drv switching!)
Xda ca dum f  fb vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=0.42 wp=0.75
Xdb cb dum fb f  vdd vss pi_tgate_lvt wn=0.42 wp=0.75
Xdn vss dum vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w={wn} l=0.15 nf=1
Xdp vdd dum vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w={wp} l=0.15 nf=1
.ends pi_slice_r

* --- 8-Slice High-Impedance Resistor-Linearized CMOS Phase Mixer ---
.subckt pi_mixer8 ca cb f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7 mix vdd vss
+ params: wn_u=0.42 wp_u=1.70 lres=10.8 cmix_w=4.1
Xs0 ca cb f0 fb0 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs1 ca cb f1 fb1 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs2 ca cb f2 fb2 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs3 ca cb f3 fb3 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs4 ca cb f4 fb4 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs5 ca cb f5 fb5 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs6 ca cb f6 fb6 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
Xs7 ca cb f7 fb7 mix vdd vss pi_slice_r wn={wn_u} wp={wp_u} lres={lres}
* Real PDK MIM slew-control capacitor (~37 fF + ~14 fF par -> tau_mix ~ 43 ps PVT-invariant!)
Xcmix mix vss sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w={cmix_w} l={cmix_w}
.ends pi_mixer8

* --- Zero-Static-DC AC-Coupled Self-Biased LVT CMOS Recovery Stage ---
* 37 fF MIM cap + 12.3 kOhm res_high_po_0p35 pure negative DC feedback: fast settling (< 3.0 ns at SS),
* high 2 GHz gain, matched V_M = VDD/2 across all PVT including SS 1.65 V -40 C!
.subckt pi_ac_rec mixp mixn r1p r1n vdd vss params: wn=1.60 wp=5.20 cac_w=4.1 lrfb=10.5
Xcp acp mixp sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w={cac_w} l={cac_w}
Xcn acn mixn sky130_fd_pr__cap_mim_m3_1 w={cac_w} l={cac_w}
Xrp acp r1p vss sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 l={lrfb}
Xrn acn r1n vss sky130_fd_pr__res_high_po_0p35 l={lrfb}
Xip acp r1p vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn={wn} wp={wp} nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin acn r1n vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn={wn} wp={wp} nfn=1 nfp=4
.ends pi_ac_rec

* --- Differential 2 GHz CMOS PI Channel (produces matched 0/180 deg pair op/on) ---
.subckt pi_diff_chan e0 e1 e2 e3 o0 o1 o2 o3
+ sa0 sa1 sa2 sa3 sab0 sab1 sab2 sab3
+ sb0 sb1 sb2 sb3 sbb0 sbb1 sbb2 sbb3
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7
+ op on vdd vss params: wn_drv=1.80 wp_drv=8.40 wn_u=0.42 wp_u=1.70 lres=10.8 cmix_w=4.1
Xmap e0 e1 e2 e3 sa0 sa1 sa2 sa3 sab0 sab1 sab2 sab3 cap vdd vss pi_mux4_tg wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv}
Xman e2 e3 e0 e1 sa0 sa1 sa2 sa3 sab0 sab1 sab2 sab3 can vdd vss pi_mux4_tg wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv}
Xmbp o0 o1 o2 o3 sb0 sb1 sb2 sb3 sbb0 sbb1 sbb2 sbb3 cbp vdd vss pi_mux4_tg wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv}
Xmbn o2 o3 o0 o1 sb0 sb1 sb2 sb3 sbb0 sbb1 sbb2 sbb3 cbn vdd vss pi_mux4_tg wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv}
* 8-slice High-Impedance Constant-Load Resistor-Linearized CMOS phase mixers
Xmixp cap cbp f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7 mixp vdd vss pi_mixer8 wn_u={wn_u} wp_u={wp_u} lres={lres} cmix_w={cmix_w}
Xmixn can cbn f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7 mixn vdd vss pi_mixer8 wn_u={wn_u} wp_u={wp_u} lres={lres} cmix_w={cmix_w}
* High-gain AC-coupled LVT recovery driving matched V_M = VDD/2 LVT output buffer (identical Wp/Wn=4.00 -> 50% duty @ SS -40C!)
Xrec mixp mixn r1p r1n vdd vss pi_ac_rec wn=1.65 wp=6.60 cac_w=4.1 lrfb=10.5
Xr2p r1n  op   vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=2.66 wp=10.64 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xr2n r1p  on   vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=2.66 wp=10.64 nfn=2 nfp=4
.ends pi_diff_chan

* --- Complete 2 GHz 64-Code CMOS Phase Interpolator Rotator (Data 0/180 + Edge 90/270) ---
.subckt serdes_rx_pi_rotator_2g c0 c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 c7
+ a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7
+ b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7
+ dp dn ep en vdd vss params: wn_drv=1.80 wp_drv=8.40 wn_u=0.42 wp_u=1.70 lres=10.8 cmix_w=4.1
* Static DC control inversions (0 uW dynamic power, L=0.18; unused odd-a / even-b terminated cleanly)
Xia0 a0 ab0 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia1 a1 ab1 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia2 a2 ab2 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia3 a3 ab3 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia4 a4 ab4 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia5 a5 ab5 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia6 a6 ab6 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xia7 a7 ab7 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib0 b0 bb0 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib1 b1 bb1 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib2 b2 bb2 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib3 b3 bb3 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib4 b4 bb4 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib5 b5 bb5 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib6 b6 bb6 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xib7 b7 bb7 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif0 f0 fb0 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif1 f1 fb1 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif2 f2 fb2 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif3 f3 fb3 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif4 f4 fb4 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif5 f5 fb5 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif6 f6 fb6 vdd vss pi_inv_static
Xif7 f7 fb7 vdd vss pi_inv_static
* Shared 2 GHz anchor clock input buffers (v2.2 balanced LVT-PMOS for full SS 1.65 V -40 C CPEX swing!)
Xin0 c0 cb0 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin1 c1 cb1 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin2 c2 cb2 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin3 c3 cb3 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin4 c4 cb4 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin5 c5 cb5 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin6 c6 cb6 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
Xin7 c7 cb7 vdd vss pi_inv_lvt wn=1.60 wp=6.40 nfn=1 nfp=4
* Data channel (0 / 180 deg): even={cb0,cb2,cb4,cb6}, odd={cb1,cb3,cb5,cb7}
Xch_d cb0 cb2 cb4 cb6 cb1 cb3 cb5 cb7
+ a0 a2 a4 a6 ab0 ab2 ab4 ab6
+ b1 b3 b5 b7 bb1 bb3 bb5 bb7
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7
+ dp dn vdd vss pi_diff_chan wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv} wn_u={wn_u} wp_u={wp_u} lres={lres} cmix_w={cmix_w}
* Edge channel (+90 / +270 deg): even={cb2,cb4,cb6,cb0}, odd={cb3,cb5,cb7,cb1}
Xch_e cb2 cb4 cb6 cb0 cb3 cb5 cb7 cb1
+ a0 a2 a4 a6 ab0 ab2 ab4 ab6
+ b1 b3 b5 b7 bb1 bb3 bb5 bb7
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7 fb0 fb1 fb2 fb3 fb4 fb5 fb6 fb7
+ ep en vdd vss pi_diff_chan wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv} wn_u={wn_u} wp_u={wp_u} lres={lres} cmix_w={cmix_w}
.ends serdes_rx_pi_rotator_2g

* --- Slimmed High-Speed Zero-Stacked-PMOS Differential Resettable Transmission-Gate Latch ---
.subckt pi_diff_latch dp_in dn_in ck ckb rst_n rst qp qn vdd vss
Xtgp_n dp_in ck  int_p vss serdes_nfet_lvt w=2.40 l=0.15 nf=2
Xtgp_p dp_in ckb int_p vdd serdes_pfet     w=4.80 l=0.15 nf=2
Xtgn_n dn_in ck  int_n vss serdes_nfet_lvt w=2.40 l=0.15 nf=2
Xtgn_p dn_in ckb int_n vdd serdes_pfet     w=4.80 l=0.15 nf=2
* Weak cross-coupled keeper (l=0.25 for fast TG overwrite @ SS 1.65V -40C!)
Xkp1 int_p int_n vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w=0.45 l=0.25 nf=1
Xkn1 int_p int_n vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w=0.42 l=0.25 nf=1
Xkp2 int_n int_p vdd vdd serdes_pfet     w=0.45 l=0.25 nf=1
Xkn2 int_n int_p vss vss serdes_nfet_lvt w=0.42 l=0.25 nf=1
* Reset switches (rst_n=0 -> int_p=0, int_n=1 -> qp=0, qn=1, 0 uA static!)
Xrp int_p rst   vss vss serdes_nfet w=1.0 l=0.18 nf=1
Xrn int_n rst_n vdd vdd serdes_pfet w=1.8 l=0.18 nf=1
* Output inverters (co-sized 3.00/9.00 for rock-solid 1.000 GHz lock @ SS 1.65V -40C full CPEX!)
Xop int_n qp vdd vss pi_inv wn=3.00 wp=9.00 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xon int_p qn vdd vss pi_inv wn=3.00 wp=9.00 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xcc qp    qn vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.42 wp=1.00
.ends pi_diff_latch

* --- Slimmed Deterministic Quadrature CMOS /2 (8-Phase 1 GHz Clock Generator) ---
.subckt serdes_rx_qdiv2_8ph dp dn ep en rst_n ckd0 ckd1 ckd2 ckd3 cke0 cke1 cke2 cke3 vdd vss
Xrst rst_n rst vdd vss pi_inv_static wn=0.6 wp=1.2
* Centered 2-stage reset-gated 2 GHz clock buffers + cross-coupled 50% duty-cycle aligners!
Xg_dpb dp rst_n dp_ckb vdd vss pi_nand2 wn=1.40 wp=4.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xg_dnb dn rst_n dn_ckb vdd vss pi_nand2 wn=1.40 wp=4.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xg_epb ep rst_n ep_ckb vdd vss pi_nand2 wn=1.40 wp=4.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xg_enb en rst_n en_ckb vdd vss pi_nand2 wn=1.40 wp=4.60 nfn=1 nfp=2
Xcc_dckb dp_ckb dn_ckb vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.50 wp=1.50
Xcc_eckb ep_ckb en_ckb vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.50 wp=1.50
Xg_dp  dp_ckb dp_ck vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.00 wp=6.90 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xg_dn  dn_ckb dn_ck vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.00 wp=6.90 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xg_ep  ep_ckb ep_ck vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.00 wp=6.90 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xg_en  en_ckb en_ck vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.00 wp=6.90 nfn=2 nfp=3
Xcc_dck  dp_ck  dn_ck  vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.50 wp=1.50
Xcc_eck  ep_ck  en_ck  vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.50 wp=1.50

* Master 1 GHz Johnson /2 on D (dp/dn) with zero-skew Stage-2 complementary clocking
Xld0 d3 d1 dp_ck dn_ck rst_n rst d0 d2 vdd vss pi_diff_latch
Xld1 d0 d2 dn_ck dp_ck rst_n rst d1 d3 vdd vss pi_diff_latch

* Deterministic Resampling Latches on E (ep/en) — zero 180 deg ambiguity across all PVT & rst_n phases!
Xle0 d0 d2 ep_ck en_ck rst_n rst e0 e2 vdd vss pi_diff_latch
Xle1 d1 d3 en_ck ep_ck rst_n rst e1 e3 vdd vss pi_diff_latch

* 1 GHz Output Buffers driving full ~40 fF real Double-Tail slicer + deser16 clock loads (< 45 ps edges @ SS -40C!)
Xbd0 d2 ckd0 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbd2 d0 ckd2 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbd1 d3 ckd1 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbd3 d1 ckd3 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbe0 e2 cke0 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbe2 e0 cke2 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbe1 e3 cke1 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xbe3 e1 cke3 vdd vss pi_inv wn=2.60 wp=6.80 nfn=2 nfp=4
Xccd0 ckd0 ckd2 vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.45 wp=1.10
Xccd1 ckd1 ckd3 vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.45 wp=1.10
Xcce0 cke0 cke2 vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.45 wp=1.10
Xcce1 cke1 cke3 vdd vss pi_cc_align wn=0.45 wp=1.10
.ends serdes_rx_qdiv2_8ph

* --- Integrated 2 GHz Ultra-Low-Power CMOS PI + Deterministic 8-Phase 1 GHz Clock Generator ---
.subckt serdes_rx_cmos_pi_8ph c0 c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 c7
+ a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7
+ b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7
+ rst_n dp dn ep en ckd0 ckd1 ckd2 ckd3 cke0 cke1 cke2 cke3 vdd vss
+ params: wn_drv=1.80 wp_drv=8.40 wn_u=0.42 wp_u=1.70 lres=10.8 cmix_w=4.1
Xpi c0 c1 c2 c3 c4 c5 c6 c7
+ a0 a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 a7
+ b0 b1 b2 b3 b4 b5 b6 b7
+ f0 f1 f2 f3 f4 f5 f6 f7
+ dp dn ep en vdd vss serdes_rx_pi_rotator_2g wn_drv={wn_drv} wp_drv={wp_drv} wn_u={wn_u} wp_u={wp_u} lres={lres} cmix_w={cmix_w}
Xdiv dp dn ep en rst_n ckd0 ckd1 ckd2 ckd3 cke0 cke1 cke2 cke3 vdd vss serdes_rx_qdiv2_8ph
.ends serdes_rx_cmos_pi_8ph
